  "description": "Prior approval under Class AA of Part 20, Schedule 2 of the GPDO (as amended) for the construction of a single storey roof extension to provide 4 new residential units.&nbsp;",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-65d809c0-7fff-4480-8f42-dadde27d78d6&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-left: 11.25pt;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Insufficient evidence has been provided to demonstrate that the existing building was constructed on or after 1 July 1948. As the provisions of Class AA, Part 20, Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) apply only to buildings constructed on or after that date, the proposal does not benefit from permitted development rights and prior approval cannot be granted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-c74a1ec2-7fff-6323-c9f8-62ed61d4f467&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-left: 11pt;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;In the absence of a completed legal agreement securing the development as car-free, the Local Planning Authority is not satisfied that the proposal would not give rise to unacceptable impacts on transport and highways. The proposal therefore fails to comply with the transport and highways consideration of Class AA, Part 20, Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
